/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 46 0 R
/E (Research Connect is an intelligent research paper search and recommendation system designed to address the growing challenge of accessing relevant academic literature from an ever-expanding collection of research publications. Traditional search methods often struggle to deliver accurate results when users provide incomplete, ambiguous, or misspelled queries. The proposed system leverages advanced searching and indexing techniques to enable efficient retrieval of research papers based on title, author, keywords, abstract content, and research domain. By integrating fuzzy search mechanisms and optimized pattern-matching algorithms, the platform significantly improves search accuracy and enhances the overall user experience.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
